---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: OPEN CITY 2027
description: DES OPEN CITY 2027 is Australia's biggest design student competition, for architecture, UI/UX and graphic design students across Victoria. $3,500 in cash prizes. Enter alone or in a team of up to three.
permalink: /open-city/
theme: des27
styles:
  - /assets/css/events.css
  - /assets/css/learn.css
  - /assets/css/open-city-landing.css
scripts:
  - /assets/js/events.js
  - /assets/js/open-city/briefs.js
  - /assets/js/open-city/landing.js
---
{# Public page about the competition. Wording: _data/opencity.json (landing).
   Dates, eligibility and prizes: the OPEN CITY entry in _data/events.json. #}
{% set event = events | byId(opencity.eventId) %}
{% set page_ = opencity.landing %}
{% set isOpen = event.registration and event.registration.status == "open" %}
{% set arrow = '<svg class="ev-arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12 12 4M5.5 4H12v6.5" /></svg>' %}
{% macro registerButton(extra = "") %}
  <a class="ev-btn ev-btn--lime ol-cta {{ extra }}" data-magnetic href="{{ opencity.registerUrl }}">
    {% if isOpen %}Register now{% else %}{{ opencity.opensShort }}{% endif %}
    {{ arrow | safe }}
  </a>
{% endmacro %}

{# ---------- Hero ---------- #}
<section class="ev-featured ol-hero" data-cursor="light" aria-labelledby="oc-title">
  <div class="ev-featured__glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <svg class="ev-featured__curve draw-line" viewBox="0 0 400 400" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">
    <path pathLength="1" d="M400 20 C 250 40, 150 120, 120 260 C 105 330, 70 380, 10 420" />
  </svg>
  {% if event.homeArt %}<img class="ol-hero__art" src="{{ event.homeArt }}" alt="" width="1360" height="1163">{% endif %}

  <div class="des-container ev-featured__inner">
    <div class="ev-featured__content">
      <p class="ev-badge reveal">{{ event.tagline }}</p>
      <h1 id="oc-title" class="ev-featured__title">
        <span class="ev-featured__big reveal" style="--delay: 100ms">{{ event.headline }}</span>
        <span class="script ev-featured__script reveal" style="--delay: 220ms">{{ event.headlineAccent }}</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="ev-featured__text reveal" style="--delay: 320ms">{{ event.summary }}</p>
      {% if event.prize %}
      <p class="ev-prize reveal" style="--delay: 360ms"><strong data-count>{{ event.prize.big }}</strong> <span class="script">{{ event.prize.label }}</span></p>
      {% endif %}
      <div class="ol-hero__actions reveal" style="--delay: 420ms">
        {{ registerButton() }}
        <a class="ev-btn" href="#brief">The brief</a>
      </div>
      <ul class="ol-stats reveal" style="--delay: 520ms">
        {% for stat in page_.heroStats %}
          <li><strong data-count>{{ stat.big }}</strong><span>{{ stat.label }}</span></li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>

    <p class="ev-featured__date reveal" style="--delay: 200ms">
      <span class="ev-featured__month">{{ event.date | datePart("month") }}</span>
      <span class="ev-featured__day script">{{ event.date | datePart("day") }}</span>
      <span class="ol-hero__datenote">{% if isOpen %}Registration open{% else %}Registration opens{% endif %}</span>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

{# ---------- What it is ---------- #}
<section class="ed-section ed-section--cream" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="des-container ol-about">
    <div>
      <h2 id="about-title" class="ev-heading reveal">
        <span class="ev-heading__big">{{ page_.introHeading.big }}</span>
        <span class="ev-heading__script script">{{ page_.introHeading.script }}</span>
      </h2>
      <div class="ed-prose ol-prose reveal" style="--delay: 120ms">
        {% for para in page_.intro %}<p>{{ para }}</p>{% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
    <ul class="ol-facts">
      {% for fact in page_.facts %}
        <li class="reveal" style="--delay: {{ loop.index0 * 90 + 150 }}ms"><strong>{{ fact.big }}</strong><span>{{ fact.label }}</span></li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

{# ---------- Prizes ---------- #}
{% set prizes = page_.prizes %}
<section class="ev-featured ol-prizes" data-cursor="light" aria-labelledby="prizes-title">
  <div class="ev-featured__glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="des-container ol-prizes__inner">
    <div>
      <h2 id="prizes-title" class="ol-prizes__title reveal">
        <span class="ev-featured__big" data-count>{{ prizes.big }}</span>
        <span class="script ev-featured__script">{{ prizes.script }}</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="ol-prizes__lead reveal" style="--delay: 100ms">{{ prizes.lead }}</p>
      <ul class="ol-prizes__extras reveal" style="--delay: 180ms">
        {% for item in prizes.extras %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal" style="--delay: 150ms">
      <table class="ol-prizes__table">
        <caption class="visually-hidden">Cash prizes by category</caption>
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">Category</th><th scope="col">1st</th><th scope="col">2nd</th><th scope="col">3rd</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for row in prizes.table %}<tr><th scope="row">{{ row.category }}</th><td>{{ row.first }}</td><td>{{ row.second }}</td><td>{{ row.third }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <p class="ol-prizes__note">{{ prizes.note }}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ---------- Categories ---------- #}
<section class="ed-section" id="brief" aria-labelledby="categories-title" data-briefs-unlock="{{ opencity.briefs.unlocksAt }}">
  <div class="des-container">
    <h2 id="categories-title" class="ev-heading reveal">
      <span class="ev-heading__big">Three</span>
      <span class="ev-heading__script script">Categories</span>
    </h2>
    <ul class="ol-cats">
      {% for cat in opencity.categories %}
        <li class="ol-cat reveal" style="--delay: {{ loop.index0 * 100 }}ms">
          <span class="ol-cat__letter script" aria-hidden="true">{{ "ABC"[loop.index0] }}</span>
          <h3>{{ cat.label }}</h3>
          <p>{{ cat.blurb }}</p>
          {# swapped for the link at the release time: assets/js/open-city/briefs.js #}
          <p class="ol-cat__lock" data-brief-locked>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="9" width="12" height="8" rx="1.5"/><path d="M7 9V6.5a3 3 0 0 1 6 0V9"/></svg>
            Brief released {{ opencity.briefs.unlocksText }}
          </p>
          <p class="ol-cat__lock" data-brief-open hidden>
            <a class="ol-cat__brief" href="{{ cat.brief }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-brief-tab data-brief-jump>Read the brief {{ arrow | safe }}</a>
          </p>
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p class="ol-locked reveal" data-brief-locked>{{ page_.locked }}</p>
    {# The brief itself, readable on the page. On phones, where PDFs can't be shown in place, the tabs open the file instead. #}
    <div class="ol-reader reveal" id="brief-reader" data-brief-open hidden>
      <h3 class="ol-reader__title">Read the brief</h3>
      <p class="ol-locked">Free for everyone to read. Each category brief has the shared rules plus that category&rsquo;s challenge; the full brief covers all three.</p>
      <div class="ol-reader__tabs">
        <a href="{{ opencity.briefs.full.file }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-brief-tab aria-current="true">Full brief</a>
        {% for cat in opencity.categories %}<a href="{{ cat.brief }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-brief-tab>{{ cat.label }}</a>{% endfor %}
      </div>
      <iframe class="ol-reader__frame" title="OPEN CITY 2027 competition brief" data-brief-frame></iframe>
      <p class="ol-reader__open"><a href="{{ opencity.briefs.full.file }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-brief-newtab>Open this brief in a new tab {{ arrow | safe }}</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ---------- How it works ---------- #}
<section class="ed-section ed-section--cream" id="how" aria-labelledby="how-title">
  <div class="des-container">
    <h2 id="how-title" class="ev-heading reveal">
      <span class="ev-heading__big">How it</span>
      <span class="ev-heading__script script">Works</span>
    </h2>
    <ol class="ol-steps">
      {% for step in page_.steps %}
        <li class="reveal" style="--delay: {{ loop.index0 * 80 }}ms">
          <span class="ol-steps__num script" aria-hidden="true">{{ loop.index }}</span>
          <h3>{{ step.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ step.text }}</p>
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
    <div class="ol-center reveal">{{ registerButton("ol-cta--dark") }}</div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ---------- Dates, who can enter, prizes ---------- #}
<section class="ed-section" aria-labelledby="dates-title">
  <div class="des-container">
    <h2 id="dates-title" class="ev-heading reveal">
      <span class="ev-heading__big">Key</span>
      <span class="ev-heading__script script">Dates</span>
    </h2>
    <ol class="ed-timeline reveal">
      {% for item in event.details.keyDates %}
        <li style="--i: {{ loop.index0 }}"><span class="ed-timeline__when">{{ item.when }}</span><span>{{ item.label }}</span></li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>

    <div class="ed-block-row">
      <div class="ed-block reveal">
        <h3>Who can enter</h3>
        <ul class="ed-list">{% for item in event.details.eligibility %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
      </div>
      <div class="ed-block reveal" style="--delay: 80ms">
        <h3>Prizes</h3>
        <ul class="ed-list">{% for item in event.details.prizes %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ---------- Questions ---------- #}
<section class="ed-section ed-section--cream" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
  <div class="des-container ol-narrow">
    <h2 id="faq-title" class="ev-heading reveal">
      <span class="ev-heading__big">Good to</span>
      <span class="ev-heading__script script">Know</span>
    </h2>
    <div class="ol-faq">
      {% for item in page_.faq %}
        <details class="reveal" style="--delay: {{ loop.index0 * 60 }}ms">
          <summary>{{ item.q }}</summary>
          <p>{{ item.a }}</p>
        </details>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="ol-contact reveal">Something else? Email <a href="mailto:{{ opencity.contactEmail }}">{{ opencity.contactEmail }}</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

{# ---------- Sign up ---------- #}
<section class="ev-featured ol-final" data-cursor="light" aria-labelledby="final-title">
  <div class="ev-featured__glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="des-container ol-final__inner">
    <h2 id="final-title" class="reveal"><span class="ev-featured__big">Ready to</span> <span class="script ev-featured__script">enter?</span></h2>
    <p class="reveal" style="--delay: 100ms">{% if isOpen %}Read the brief, sign up and pay your entry.{% else %}{{ opencity.opensText }} Already started? Pick up where you left off.{% endif %}</p>
    <div class="ol-hero__actions reveal" style="--delay: 200ms">
      {{ registerButton() }}
      <a class="ev-btn" href="{{ opencity.registerUrl }}">Continue my entry</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
